DESCRIPTION:Chayyei Sarah (“The Life of Sarah”) opens as Sarah dies an
 d Abraham buys the Cave of Machpelah to bury her. Abraham sends his servan
 t to find a wife for Isaac. The servant meets Rebecca at a well\, and Rebe
 cca returns with the servant to marry Isaac. Abraham remarries\, has more 
 children\, and dies at age 175.\n\nTorah: Genesis 23:1-25:18\nHaftarah: I 
 Kings 1:1-31\n\nhttps://hebcal.com/s/5787/5?uc=ical-diaspora
